  "id": "qt",
  "term": "QT",
  "definition": "In this source, QT refers to quality testing used in fNIRS research to evaluate the quality of near-infrared scan data. It is described as part of a data-quality assessment approach for studying brain activity during cognitive tasks and exercise.",
